From ce8eefd5b02ca862575ce88fd1c3fea0ebeccf07 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: omalawn <omalawn@local>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 17:43:47 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] omalawn lock screen wallpaper

launcher.wallpaper_set {path, which} sets the home screen ("home",
FLAG_SYSTEM, the default, so older desktops keep working), the lock screen
("lock", FLAG_LOCK) or both. launcher.wallpaper_backup {which} reads the
home or the lock screen picture; a lock screen without a picture of its own
(it shows the home one) is refused with lock_follows_home.
launcher.wallpaper_lock_reset drops the lock screen's own picture so it
shows the home one again (Android re-numbers the home wallpaper then).
launcher.wallpaper_info adds lock_follows_home and the screen's size in
pixels, portrait (width, height), for cropping on the computer. The link
accepts which on both calls.
---
 .../app/lawnchair/omalawn/OmalawnCommands.kt  | 87 +++++++++++++++----
 .../app/lawnchair/omalawn/link/LinkServer.kt  |  5 +-
 2 files changed, 74 insertions(+), 18 deletions(-)

